# Trivy ignore file — read by both publish workflows (`trivyignores: .trivyignore`) for the
# platform images' CRITICAL/HIGH report and the CRITICAL-fixed publish gate (ADR-030).
#
# The gate already ignores findings with no upstream fix (`ignore-unfixed: true`). An entry here
# therefore suppresses a *fixable* finding for every platform image — treat it as an exception that
# must expire. Every entry is:
#
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN
#   # image(s): <repo>[:<tag>]; why: <one line>; added: YYYY-MM-DD; removed by: #<issue>
#
# Empty at introduction (#266). The first publish run after merge proves the gate is clean; add an
# entry only with a maintainer decision and an issue number that removes it.
